OL,3,GNEWSANew 20mph speed limits approved
OL,4,Afor 60 streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew 20mph speed limit zones are set to
OL,7,Fbe introduced on 60 streets in
OL,8,FLeicester.
OL,10,FThe measures in the Saffron and
OL,11,FThurncourt areas will come into force
OL,12,Ffrom spring 2027 after being approved
OL,13,Fby the city council.
OL,15,FThe authority said the scheme, which is
OL,16,Festimated to cost #140,000, is part of
OL,17,Fa wider rollout of 20mph zones across
OL,18,Fthe city.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
