OL,3,GNEWSANew 20mph speed limits approved
OL,4,Afor 60 streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Geoff Whittle, assistant
OL,7,Fcity mayor for environment and
OL,8,Ftransport, said the measure would
OL,9,F"lower the risk of serious collisions,
OL,10,Fcut traffic noise, discourage dangerous
OL,11,Fdriving, and make it easier for people
OL,12,Fto choose walking, wheeling and cycling
OL,13,Ffor everyday journeys".
